  <!-- COMMON JOBS -->
  <section class="pf-section" style="background:#f8fafc;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Common Emergencies We Fix Across Formby</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub">The plumbing faults we attend most frequently across L37, Freshfield, Hightown and surrounding Sefton coast villages.</p>
      <div class="jobs-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
        <div class="job-card"><h3>Burst Pipes and Water Damage</h3><div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">£120 to £350</span><span class="job-time">30 to 90 mins</span></div><p>In a large Formby property, a burst pipe can cause real water damage fast across many floors. The faster we get there, the less damage is done. That is why our 30 minute response matters. We stop the leak, check the damage and repair or swap the bad section on the first visit.</p></div>
        <div class="job-card"><h3>No Hot Water and Boiler Breakdown</h3><div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">£150 to £500</span><span class="job-time">45 to 120 mins</span></div><p>Formby homes often have modern condensing boilers and unvented cylinders. When these fail, you lose hot water across the whole house instantly. We diagnose and repair on the same visit with parts from the van. Gas Safe engineers only on all boiler work in L37.</p></div>
